{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":214,"count":41,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L05-2-17\",\"弟弟\",\"弟弟\",\"弟弟\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"弟弟在門後面。","pinyin":"Dìdi zài mén hòumiàn.","english":"My younger brother is behind the door.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-3-06","sourceFront":"門","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":3},{"chinese":"我弟弟喜歡打棒球，我想送他一個棒球。","pinyin":"Wǒ dìdi xǐhuān dǎ bàngqiú, wǒ xiǎng sòng tā yí ge bàngqiú.","english":"My younger brother likes playing baseball, I’d like to give him a baseball as a gift.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-1-05","sourceFront":"棒球","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"弟(younger brother), said twice: 弟弟(younger brother)."},{"key":"[\"B1L06-1-08\",\"海邊\",\"海邊\",\"海边\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"今天天氣不錯，我們去海邊曬太陽吧。","pinyin":"Jīntiān tiānqì búcuò, wǒmen qù hǎibiān shài tàiyáng ba.","english":"The weather is nice today. Let’s go to the beach to get some sun!","sourceCardId":"B1L06-1-08","sourceFront":"海邊","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"你喜歡山上的風景還是海邊的風景？","pinyin":"Nǐ xǐhuān shānshàng de fēngjǐng háishì hǎibiān de fēngjǐng?","english":"Do you like the scenery on the mountain or on the beach?","sourceCardId":"B1L06-1-11","sourceFront":"風景","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"今天天氣不錯，海邊的風景也很漂亮，我想去游泳，妳們想去嗎？","pinyin":"Jīntiān tiānqì búcuò, hǎibiān de fēngjǐng yě hěn piàoliàng, wǒ xiǎng qù yóuyǒng, nǐmen xiǎng qù ma?","english":"The weather is pretty good today, so is the view at the beach. I want to go swimming. Do you want to go?","sourceCardId":"B1L06-1-01","sourceFront":"打","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2}],"wordHook":"海(sea) + 邊(side) → the sea's side: 海邊(seaside; beach)."},{"key":"[\"B1L07-1-13\",\"计程车\",\"計程車\",\"计程车\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"你不想坐公車，那(麼)我們坐計程車吧。","pinyin":"Nǐ bù xiǎng zuò gōngchē, nà(me) wǒmen zuò jìchéngchē ba.","english":"You don't want to take the bus; then let's take a taxi.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-1-09","sourceFront":"那麼","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"因為我趕時間，所以得搭計程車去車站。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-2-14","sourceFront":"趕","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我等了半天公車還是沒來，只好坐計程車去上班。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-1-25","sourceFront":"半天","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"從這裡走路回家有一點兒距離，而且現在還下著大雨，我們還是搭計程車算了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-31","sourceFront":"距離","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我沒趕上最後一班公車，這下子只好搭計程車回家了","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-20","sourceFront":"這下子","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"過年時什麼都漲，連搭計程車的時候，車費都漲價了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-43","sourceFront":"漲","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L07-3-06\",\"司机\",\"司機\",\"司机\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"那位司機開車開得很好。","pinyin":"Nà wèi sījī kāichē kāi de hěn hǎo.","english":"That driver drives very well.","sourceCardId":"B1L07-3-06","sourceFront":"司機","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這個城市的公車司機不找錢，要是你沒有公車卡，就得自己準備零錢。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-2-20","sourceFront":"零錢","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L15-1-06\",\"课本\",\"課本\",\"课本\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我記得有羊、馬、兔子……，最特別的是龍。（打開課本）妳看看……","pinyin":"Wǒ jìdé yǒu yáng, mǎ, tùzi..., zuì tèbié de shì lóng. (dǎkāi kèběn) Nǐ kànkan...","english":"I remember there are goats, horses, rabbits..., and the most special one is the dragon. (Open the textbook) You see...","sourceCardId":"B1L15-1-01","sourceFront":"生肖","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L15-3-14\",\"雞\",\"雞\",\"鸡\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"炸雞排是我最喜歡的小吃。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L04-1-15","sourceFront":"雞排","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"你只買了一份雞排，吃得飽嗎？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L04-2-21","sourceFront":"飽","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"你剛剛說要吃漢堡，現在說要吃炸雞，到底要吃什麼？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-1-44","sourceFront":"到底","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"今年的年夜飯有很多菜，雞鴨魚肉什麼都有。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-2-04","sourceFront":"鴨子","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"下了好幾天的大雨，不但到處淹水，連我家養的雞、鴨也淹死了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-17","sourceFront":"淹","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"氣象預報人員確定明天颱風會來，我們最好去吃超市買一些泡麵、雞蛋","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-29","sourceFront":"確定","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"「先有雞還是先有蛋」，這個問題有標準答案嗎？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-09","sourceFront":"標準","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"因為冰箱壞了，裡面的食物除了雞蛋、蘋果，其他的都腐敗了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-25","sourceFront":"腐敗","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"奶奶養了幾隻雞，每天早上習慣抓兩把玉米餵牠們。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-27","sourceFront":"把","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"a 奚(where?) basket traps a 隹(bird) in the yard → 雞(chicken)."},{"key":"[\"B2L01-2-15\",\"幸運\",\"幸運\",\"幸运\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他玩遊戲贏了一萬塊錢，真幸運！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L01-2-15","sourceFront":"幸運","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"他參加百貨公司的活動，抽到一台價格六萬元的平板電腦， 真是太幸運了！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-11","sourceFront":"抽","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小李第一次參加釣魚比賽就得了第一名，真是幸運。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-01","sourceFront":"得","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L03-1-08\",\"上去\",\"上去\",\"上去\",\"Vi\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他住在五樓，我們上去找他吧。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-1-08","sourceFront":"上去","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我們上禮拜到山上去看日出了，好漂亮！","pinyin":"Wǒmen shàng lǐbài dào shān shàng qù kàn rìchū le, hǎo piàoliang!","english":"Last week we went up the mountain to see the sunrise; it was so beautiful!","sourceCardId":"B1L14-2-17","sourceFront":"日出","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"他每天早上去上班，晚上去上課，真辛苦！","pinyin":"Tā měi tiān zǎoshang qù shàngbān, wǎnshang qù shàngkè, zhēn xīnkǔ!","english":"He goes to work every morning and goes to class in the evening; it's really tough!","sourceCardId":"B1L12-2-02","sourceFront":"辛苦","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L04-2-28\",\"鹹酥雞\",\"鹹酥雞\",\"咸酥鸡\",\"N\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L07-2-23\",\"成功\",\"成功\",\"成功\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"到東部的火車票很難訂，我訂了好幾次才成功。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-2-23","sourceFront":"成功","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這次社區的中秋節活動辦得很成功，大家都玩得很開心。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-2-23","sourceFront":"成功","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"用不同的方法教育不同的學生，這樣才是成功的教育方式。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-1-25","sourceFront":"教育","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他吹笛子吹得很好，辦過幾場很成功的音樂表演。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-1-15","sourceFront":"笛子","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那個明星很會演戲，演了幾年戲就開始當導演，沒想到第一部戲就成功了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-15","sourceFront":"導演","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們樂團今晚的表演很成功，一起放煙火來慶祝吧！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-27","sourceFront":"煙火","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有一份研究報告表示，對陌生環境適應能力越強的人，未來成功的機會也越高。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-18","sourceFront":"陌生","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他把存了半輩子的錢都拿去做生意，結果生意不成功，錢都沒了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-22","sourceFront":"沒","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"「每個成功男人的背後，都有一個偉大的女人。」你覺得這句話有道理嗎？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-04","sourceFront":"背後","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"易先生對戲劇有很大的興趣，小時候的夢想就是當一名成功的演員。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-2-16","sourceFront":"戲劇","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"好的開始是成功的一半，第一步往往最重要。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-37","sourceFront":"步","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"要想成為成功的上班族，一切就得照規矩來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-2-05","sourceFront":"成為","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"看見別人事業很成功，除了羨慕以外，更要學習他的優點。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-2-13","sourceFront":"羨慕","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"樂觀的人會積極挑戰困難，就算無法成功也不會感到失望。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-24","sourceFront":"感到","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"人人都崇拜明星，但有多少人了解成功背後所付出的一切？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-29","sourceFront":"崇拜","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"別怕失敗，因為失敗的經驗比成功更珍貴。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-10","sourceFront":"失敗","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L08-1-33\",\"那樣\",\"那樣\",\"那样\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"不少人喜歡買像史努比那樣可愛的娃娃。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L08-1-33","sourceFront":"那樣","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"像珍珠奶茶那樣的飲料，在日本也很受歡迎。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L08-1-14","sourceFront":"那樣","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我妹妹非常喜愛像Hello Kitty那樣的卡通人物。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L08-1-24","sourceFront":"喜愛","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"像慢跑、游泳那樣的運動，對健康極有幫助。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L11-2-19","sourceFront":"極","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"像踢足球那樣的運動，對年紀大的人不太合適。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-04","sourceFront":"合適","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"李先生從不吃泡麵、薯條、熱狗那樣的食物，因為他覺得不健康。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-1-34","sourceFront":"從不","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"像衝浪、滑雪那樣的戶外活動，又刺激又好玩，不用說，絕對能吸引青少年。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-08","sourceFront":"不用說","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"每個人一輩子都會遇到像沒考上大學、找不到工作那樣的挫折，但只要努力就有希望。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-03","sourceFront":"挫折","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"假如東西買回家後常擺著不用，那樣的消費就是不必要的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-03","sourceFront":"消費","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"鄉村生活雖然不如都市那樣方便，但風景美多了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-33","sourceFront":"鄉村","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"像足球、籃球那樣激烈的運動，常讓運動員的小腿、手、腳受傷。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-23","sourceFront":"小腿","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"雖然他已經親自說了對不起，但還是很後悔做出那樣沒禮貌的行為，於是再度向各位道歉。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-05","sourceFront":"再度","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L08-1-39\",\"一開始\",\"一開始\",\"一开始\",\"Ph\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"新年是一個新的開始，所以每年一開始就要做好計畫。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L08-1-39","sourceFront":"一開始","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"外國學生一開始學寫漢字的速度比較慢，只要多練習就能越寫越快了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-2-29","sourceFront":"速度","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"一開始奧運僅安排男子比賽項目，後來才有女子項目的比賽。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-12","sourceFront":"男子","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L09-1-32\",\"够\",\"夠\",\"够\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"你的能力夠好，做這個工作一定沒問題。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-1-32","sourceFront":"夠","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這本書要一千五百塊錢，我跟他的錢加起來還不夠。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L04-1-23","sourceFront":"加起來","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"A:這些點心夠不夠？ B:夠了，夠了，我們已經吃過午飯了。","pinyin":"A: Zhèxiē diǎnxin gòu bu gòu? B: Gòu le, gòu le, wǒmen yǐjīng chī guo wǔfàn le.","english":"A: Are these snacks enough? B: Enough, enough; we have already eaten lunch.","sourceCardId":"B1L12-2-08","sourceFront":"夠","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我花了大約兩萬塊錢學做法國菜，希望能夠快點兒學會。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L13-1-29","sourceFront":"能夠","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"孔子希望君王能夠接受他的建議來管理國家。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-12","sourceFront":"君王","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}