ront":"當成","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在指導演員的表達方式上，這位導演的經驗相當豐富。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-10","sourceFront":"指導","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那只鑽石戒指的設計極有特色，很適合當作婚戒(wedding ring)。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-38","sourceFront":"戒指","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"a 扌(hand) holds a 旨(aim) steady on the map → one pointing 指(finger)."},{"key":"[\"B2L15-1-16\",\"南方\",\"南方\",\"南方\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"在中國，大多數南方人吃飯，北方人吃麵和水餃。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-1-16","sourceFront":"南方","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"在中國，大多數南方人吃飯，北方人吃麵和水餃。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-1-17","sourceFront":"北方","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"日本在台灣的東北方；台灣在中國的東南方。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-2-03","sourceFront":"東北","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"日本在台灣的東北方；台灣在中國的東南方。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-2-05","sourceFront":"東南","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"中國南北方的飲食習慣有一些差異，南方人多吃米飯，北方人多吃餃子、饅頭等麵食。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-15","sourceFront":"米飯","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L01-1-06\",\"戲\",\"戲\",\"戏\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這部戲不但明星演得好，劇本也寫得不錯，所以票賣得非常好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-10","sourceFront":"劇本","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我妹妹不但長得漂亮，身高也夠高，十六歲就有人找她演戲了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-22","sourceFront":"身高","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"東賢演什麼像什麼，每部戲都演得非常好，觀眾對他的表現非常肯定","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-29","sourceFront":"肯定","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"那個明星演戲前都會先研究戲裡的人物、故事，最後才決定表演的方式。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-04","sourceFront":"演戲","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"那個明星很會演戲，演了幾年戲就開始當導演，沒想到第一部戲就成功了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-15","sourceFront":"導演","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"那個演員非常喜歡演戲，不管導演給他多麼難演的角色，他都願意試試看。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-25","sourceFront":"多麼","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"台灣的夜市很有特色，除了有各式各樣的小吃，還有不少好玩的遊戲。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L06-2-13","sourceFront":"各式各樣","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"他玩遊戲贏了一萬塊錢，真幸運！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L01-2-15","sourceFront":"幸運","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"他喜歡玩手機遊戲，差不多每天玩兩個小時。","pinyin":"Tā xǐhuan wán shǒujī yóuxì, chàbuduō měitiān wán liǎng ge xiǎoshí.","english":"He likes to play mobile games, and plays for about two hours almost every day.","sourceCardId":"B1L16-3-12","sourceFront":"遊戲","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"美美剛進模特兒公司時，有一位導演找她演戲，沒想到就讓她變成了有名的明星。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-2-12","sourceFront":"進","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我昨天晚上做了一個夢，夢到跟我最喜歡的明星一同演戲，開心得不得了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-07","sourceFront":"一同","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"陳老師為了引起學生的學習興趣，每次上課前都會準備一些有趣的遊戲。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-38","sourceFront":"引起","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那個女演員演戲的樣子很自然，一點也不誇張，難怪導演很欣賞她。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-12","sourceFront":"自然","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"父母要經常陪孩子聊天、玩遊戲，給零用錢不能完全滿足孩子的需要。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-25","sourceFront":"需要","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這部戲的男主角英俊、女主角漂亮，加上演員都演得很好，所以非常受歡迎。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-11","sourceFront":"主角","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我是金東賢的戲迷，今天終於看到他本人，實在太開心了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-09","sourceFront":"本人","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有了無線網路，就可以隨時隨地上網查資料、看影片，或是玩遊戲。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-35","sourceFront":"隨時隨地","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"老師把安養院社團的社員分成兩個小組，第一組陪老人唱歌， 第二組陪老人玩遊戲。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-21","sourceFront":"組","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"易先生對戲劇有很大的興趣，小時候的夢想就是當一名成功的演員。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-2-16","sourceFront":"戲劇","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我玩了整晚的手機遊戲，結果第二天差點被爸爸打一頓。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-49","sourceFront":"頓","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"中國人看傳統戲劇時都喜歡準備一盤瓜子，邊吃邊欣賞。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-39","sourceFront":"瓜子","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有些國家的傳統戲劇常利用影子和燈光效果來表演。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-2-19","sourceFront":"影子","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"孩子：我玩電腦遊戲玩得正高興，你為什麼不讓我繼續玩？爸爸：得了！你玩到眼睛都紅了。去外面運動運動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-59","sourceFront":"得了","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"到機場時看見一群戲迷正追著電影明星照相，真有意思。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-01","sourceFront":"追","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小寒特別喜愛射氣球遊戲，每次去逛夜市時總要完五、六回。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-05","sourceFront":"射","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"a 䖒(tiger eating beans) mask rests by the 戈(dagger-axe) → one lively 戲(game)."},{"key":"[\"B3L02-1-21\",\"白菜\",\"白菜\",\"白菜\",\"N\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 白(for nothing) and 菜(vegetables): 白菜 means Chinese cabbage."},{"key":"[\"B3L02-1-24\",\"需求\",\"需求\",\"需求\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"為了符合市場的需求，「快時尚」公司不斷地設計出最流行的服裝樣式。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-19","sourceFront":"符合","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"網路商店滿足了人們購物的需求，就是不出門，也可買到各式各樣的生活用品。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-08","sourceFront":"可","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這家公司非常重視每位客戶的需求。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-08","sourceFront":"客戶","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"購物是一種享受，超過個人需求的消費，卻只會帶來煩惱。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-43","sourceFront":"享受","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"根據手機公司的分析，明年大尺寸手機的市場需求會提高五倍以上。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-46","sourceFront":"分析","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"公司如果關心客戶並達成他們的需求，對業務或多或少有好處。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-13","sourceFront":"或多或少","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這家廠商針對老年人的需求生產了一種新奶粉。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-18","sourceFront":"奶粉","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在抗議新建工廠的活動中，當地的環保團體聯合起來表達他們的需求。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-38","sourceFront":"聯合","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 需(need) and 求(beg): 需求 means need, require."},{"key":"[\"B3L03-2-02\",\"购物\",\"購物\",\"购物\",\"Vi\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我喜歡在網路商店購物，除了能省不少時間，還可以把商品送到家。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-2-02","sourceFront":"購物","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"購物時我喜歡一個人慢慢看，不太喜歡店員一直向我推銷。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-2-08","sourceFront":"推銷","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"越來越多人選擇上網購物，有的是為了節省時間，有的是因為比價很方便。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-2-17","sourceFront":"節省","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我覺得住在鄉下除了購物不方便以外，什麼都好","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-19","sourceFront":"以外","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小溫規劃的旅遊行程，有參觀、購物、看表演等活動，我相信大家會很滿意。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-04","sourceFront":"行程","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小溫規劃的旅遊行程，有參觀、購物、看表演等活動，我相信大家會很滿意。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-2-04","sourceFront":"歌仔戲","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"刷卡購物時，店員會先確認你的簽名是不是和信用卡上的相同。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-2-12","sourceFront":"確認","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"對連電腦都不知道怎麼打開的人來說，上網購物是一件非常困難的事情。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-2-25","sourceFront":"困難","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"因為工作太忙的關係，夏小姐已經有一段時間沒上街購物了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-21","sourceFront":"上街","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"購物時，最好要貨比三家，才能買到品質較佳、價格較合理的商品。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-10","sourceFront":"較","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"網路商店滿足了人們購物的需求，就是不出門，也可買到各式各樣的生活用品。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-08","sourceFront":"可","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"古先生很重視環保，購物時會準備環保袋，在餐廳吃飯也會用環保筷。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-10","sourceFront":"環保","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這座古老的城市因為公共設備太舊，購物也不方便，不少人都搬走了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-05","sourceFront":"古老","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"一般購物網站都是等收到顧客的匯款後，才寄出商品的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-07","sourceFront":"匯款","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"購物時不能只看包裝，品質才是最重要的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-50","sourceFront":"包裝","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"購物網站會把常見的購物問題及處理方式放在網頁上，提供給顧客參考。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-03","sourceFront":"常見","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"拿到購物收據，要是發現算錯帳了，就請店員再算一次。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-07","sourceFront":"算帳","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"購物是一種享受，超過個人需求的消費，卻只會帶來煩惱。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-43","sourceFront":"享受","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"很多人購物不在乎商品的品牌，只要耐用就好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-11","sourceFront":"耐用","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"環保署規定禁止使用塑膠袋後，使用購物袋的人就漸漸增加了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-24","sourceFront":"漸漸","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"由於網路發達，現代人大都習慣上網購物。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-14","sourceFront":"大都","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"網路購物辦理退貨時，必須保持商品原來的外觀才行。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-20","sourceFront":"外觀","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L09-1-27\",\"请教\",\"請教\",\"请教\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這堂語法課的內容比較難，學生有任何問題都可以舉手請教老師。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-27","sourceFront":"請教","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"A:對這次新產品的銷售方式，你有什麼想法？ B:我在這方面沒什麼經驗，你可以去請教方經理。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-07","sourceFront":"方面","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"雖然藍先生是大學的校長，可是他很謙虛，經常向同事請教管理學校的方法。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-12","sourceFront":"謙虛","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我剛來臺灣，不知道怎麼在銀行開戶存錢，請教我怎麼申請。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-48","sourceFront":"申請","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我的親戚是數學教授，每次我有這方面的問題就向他請教。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-2-10","sourceFront":"親戚","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"李伯伯對做家事有很多妙主意，因此附近的鄰居常向他請教。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-08","sourceFront":"妙","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"從事新工作時往往經驗不足，因此向別人請教是必需的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-07","sourceFront":"不足","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"她的專業是人工智慧，這個領域的問題可以請教她。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-17","sourceFront":"人工智慧","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L12-1-23\",\"原谅\",\"原諒\",\"原谅\",\"Vst\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"A:要是你發現男朋友對你越來越冷淡，還常跟女網友約會， 你會原諒他嗎？ B:這麼花心的男人，絕對不值得原諒。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-23","sourceFront":"原諒","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"那個壞人殺了人，他知道自己錯了，到教堂去請求上帝原諒。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-22","sourceFront":"請求","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:犯錯的人都可以請求原諒嗎？ B:得看他犯的是什麼錯，要是小小的錯，就該原諒吧。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-2-12","sourceFront":"錯","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他跟我道歉時一點兒誠意都沒有，所以我不會原諒他。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-2-17","sourceFront":"誠意","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L15-1-18\",\"广场\",\"廣場\",\"广场\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"一大早就有不少民眾在寺廟前的廣場上運動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-18","sourceFront":"廣場","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"市中心有座正方形的廣場，民眾經常到那裡散步。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-05","sourceFront":"正方形","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這座圓形廣場是為了紀念自由而建的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-12","sourceFront":"圓形","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"總統在廣場點燃煙火，跟民眾一起慶祝新年。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-28","sourceFront":"點燃","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L01-1-01\",\"业务员\",\"業務員\",\"业务员\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"那位業務員不但謙虛而且誠實，你有需要的話可以請他協助。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-01","sourceFront":"業務員","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L04-2-10\",\"生长\",\"生長\",\"生长\",\"Vi\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"假如缺乏陽光、空氣和水這三項條件，植物就無法生長。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-2-10","sourceFront":"生長","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"每次看到有河流經過的都市，就會想起我生長的家鄉。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-46","sourceFront":"河流","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"阿溫對花草很有興趣，不論生長在平原或山地的，他都叫得出名字來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-27","sourceFront":"花草","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L08-1-20\",\"人體\",\"人體\",\"人体\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我對人體各部分的功能