,"rank":4},{"chinese":"麗麗的老公在她生日那天，送了她九十九朵玫瑰花，好浪漫啊！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-27","sourceFront":"浪漫","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"報名衝浪課的手續很簡單，只要到辦公室填一張基本資料表就行了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-28","sourceFront":"表","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"像衝浪、滑雪那樣的戶外活動，又刺激又好玩，不用說，絕對能吸引青少年。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-08","sourceFront":"不用說","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"這個週末我過得很充實，不但完成了期末報告，還跟同學去游泳、衝浪。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-07","sourceFront":"充實","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"既然你不想衝浪，那就坐在海灘上曬曬太陽吧！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-39","sourceFront":"既然","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"夏天一到，這個海灘上就會看到許多人帶著衝浪板來衝浪。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-28","sourceFront":"衝浪板","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"夏天在海灘上踏著浪散步，是一件非常享受的事。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-16","sourceFront":"踏","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他用很珍貴的茶具來泡品質很普通的茶葉，真浪費。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-07","sourceFront":"普通","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"A 氵(water) surfer finds a 良(good) wave and rides it until it curls into a 浪(breaker)."},{"key":"[\"B4L09-1-41\",\"有些\",\"有些\",\"有些\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"經過我的說明，他反而有些糊塗了，看來我的解釋不太清楚。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-41","sourceFront":"有些","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"有些國家機場對攜帶物品的規定很嚴，出國前最好了解清楚。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-25","sourceFront":"嚴","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"有些事明明不對，卻因沒人敢說，久了以後就被社會接受了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-13","sourceFront":"明明","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"有些國家的傳統戲劇常利用影子和燈光效果來表演。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-2-19","sourceFront":"影子","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"逃避或許是解決問題的一種方式，但有些問題是你逃不了，不得不解決的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-12","sourceFront":"逃","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"有些運動中心規定個人得帶自己的毛巾，否則不可以進去。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-2-05","sourceFront":"毛巾","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"有些國家為了吸引更多的觀光客來旅遊，就把一些出境、入境的手續改簡單了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-59","sourceFront":"有些","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"東部山區一連下了好幾天的大雨，有些房子倒了，公路也塌了，造成不少意外。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-13","sourceFront":"山區","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"有些人等待了一輩子，都等不到高升的機會。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-14","sourceFront":"等待","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"在夜市買東西的時候，有些人會跟老闆殺價。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L04-1-10","sourceFront":"殺","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"有些事忍耐一下就過去了，什麼都想以吵架的方式解決，遲早會出事的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-14","sourceFront":"出事","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有些病頭幾個月的症狀不明顯，得做進一步的檢查才能確定。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-2-04","sourceFront":"症狀","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那位教授提供病毒給軍隊使用，有些人認為他應該出來道歉。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-2-05","sourceFront":"病毒","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有些女性懷孕時飲食習慣會有極大的改變，醫生說這是正常現象。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-2-11","sourceFront":"懷孕